---
description: ReasonLab checkpoint and handoff workflow for all project work
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and follow the repository-root `AGENTS.md` before making changes.
Keep `docs/STATUS.md`, `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` and `docs/CHANGELOG.md` aligned with code.
Make tested, reviewed commits and normal fast-forward pushes at meaningful working milestones.
Never push secrets, runtime data, unrelated changes, or unverified completion claims.
Do not schedule autonomous periodic Git pushes; checkpoint during active authorised work.
